+# Bound-account invitation recipients
+
+Full-binding `POST /api/account-bindings/v1/calendar/invitations/` additionally accepts
+`subjects: [IMMUTABLE_CALENDAR_SUBJECT_UUID]` instead of shares/emails. Do not mix
+these recipient forms. Maximum 20 unique recipients, excluding the organizer.
+Every recipient must have an active full binding to the same enabled client and
+must allow invitations. Unknown, revoked, expired, foreign-client and unavailable
+recipients fail closed with `invitation_recipient_unavailable` (403).
+
+The existing send/notify scopes, transactional idempotency, invitation rate limits,
+organizer identity, invitation outbox and accept/decline behavior are unchanged.
+Recipients remain pending; no recipient event is written before their acceptance.
+Subject resolution does not issue or return sharing links, keys or credentials.
+The idempotency fingerprint retains the original subjects request. Replay checks
+current recipient binding authority before returning the recorded result.
